# The remote launcher is embedded with `include_str!` and executed by `sh` on a POSIX
# host. Under `core.autocrlf=true` the working tree copy is CRLF, so a Windows build
# would compile CRLF into the binary and the shebang line would fail on Linux. Pinning
# it to LF makes the checked-out bytes the shipped bytes.
remote-launcher/pi-desktop-launcher text eol=lf
